{"meta":{"id":"ng-ex-js-output-order","title":"Bài tập: đoán thứ tự in ra — setTimeout, Promise, queueMicrotask và async/await","track":"angular","topic":"javascript","tags":["javascript","event-loop","output-prediction"],"type":"code-challenge","level":"mid","domain":[],"asked_at":[],"minutes":12,"status":"done","verified_on":"2026-11-09","ng_version":"22","private":false,"related":["ng-js-event-loop","ng-js-promise-async"],"srs":true,"sources":[],"layer":"exercise","askedAt":[],"verifiedOn":"2026-11-09","ngVersion":"22"},"intro":"","sections":[{"key":"question","label":"Câu hỏi","role":"prompt","answer":false,"empty":false,"html":"<p>Không chạy code, hãy viết ra thứ tự log của ba đoạn sau và giải thích từng bước.</p>\n<div class=\"ih-code\" data-lang=\"js\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Đoạn 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4